      en: ["Located on the northern coast of São Tomé.", "Important nesting site for Green and Hawksbill turtles.", "Focus on community involvement and education.", "Volunteers patrol beaches to protect nests.", "Collaboration with local fishing communities.", "Provides a base camp for researchers and volunteers.", "Former poachers often become conservation rangers."],
