      en: ["The square is situated in the city center of São Tomé.", "Independence was proclaimed here on July 12, 1975.", "It is surrounded by buildings dating back to the colonial era.", "The playground was modernized to promote social interaction.", "It serves as the primary venue for Independence Day celebrations.", "Praça da Independência is the most significant public space in the city."],
      es: ["Ubicado en una plaza histórica central.", "Uno de los pocos parques infantiles públicos en la ciudad de São Tomé.", "Importante punto de encuentro social para familias.", "Equipado con columpios, toboganes y estructuras para trepar.", "Ofrece un espacio seguro para juegos infantiles.", "Rodeado de arquitectura colonial histórica.", "Gratuito y accesible para todos."],
